##
## Star Destroyer demo parameter file.
##
## All interaction energies are ZERO: the system is pure excluded volume, so the
## 2-bead "spaceships" simply fly around freely (random walk), bouncing off each
## other and off the frozen Star Destroyer hull rather than sticking to it.
##
## Bead types:  H = hull,  T = tower/superstructure,  S = spaceship
##

## ANGLE PENALTIES (must be defined for every bead type, even if zero)
ANGLE_PENALTY	H	0	0	0
ANGLE_PENALTY	T	0	0	0
ANGLE_PENALTY	S	0	0	0

## PAIRWISE INTERACTIONS (all zero -> excluded volume only)
H	H	0
H	T	0
H	S	0
T	T	0
T	S	0
S	S	0

## bead-solvent interactions (the "<type> 0 <energy>" lines)
H	0	0
T	0	0
S	0	0
